WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:05.083
GTA 6 HQ is an unofficial
fan encyclopedia for Windows.

00:00:05.483 --> 00:00:10.467
An encyclopedia and a
Field Manual in one app.

00:00:10.867 --> 00:00:14.022
The Home page has a live
wallpaper and a countdown.

00:00:14.422 --> 00:00:17.578
73 entries in 12 categories.

00:00:17.978 --> 00:00:21.133
Character pages list their sources.

00:00:21.533 --> 00:00:24.689
A zoomable map with 15 markers.

00:00:25.089 --> 00:00:31.750
A 38-page Field Manual
with two-page spreads.

00:00:37.533 --> 00:00:40.689
Every entry carries a confidence label.

00:00:41.089 --> 00:00:45.972
It installs for your user account
only. No administrator access needed.

00:00:46.372 --> 00:00:51.306
Download it from GitHub.
